  "question": {
    "text": "<p>An analyst wants to convert <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>HCl</mi></math>&nbsp;of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> to a solution of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math>&nbsp;of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. The volume of water needed to do this dilution is _____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mL</mi></math>. (Nearest integer)</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "9000",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></math>&nbsp;or say <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math>&nbsp;in both the given solution is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> mole <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> respectively.</p><p>For the given amount of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math>&nbsp;the concentration depends over dilution hence</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mL</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10000</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mL</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9000</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mL</mi></math></p>",
